# {{name}} Ops

Visibility ops repo for **{{name}}**. Runs against the methodology repo at `../../aeo-os/`.

## Structure

Follows the canonical client folder structure (see [methodology decision record](../../aeo-os/docs/decisions/2026-05-15-client-folder-structure.md)).

### Foundation
- `config/` — ICP, brand brain, voice guide, pillars, keywords
- `brand/` — visual identity, logos, brand kit

### Brain
- `research/` — one-time deep dives, competitor analysis, audience research
- `intelligence/` — ongoing scans, weekly scorecards, gap reports (machine-written)
- `vault/` — human-curated knowledge, Obsidian notes, swipe files

### Brand (output)
- `content/` — produced assets by channel (`linkedin/`, `email/`, `blog/`)
- `production/` — larger productions (podcast, video, audits)

### Cross-stage
- `playbooks/` — client-specific reusable patterns
- `ops/` — scheduled jobs, integrations, automations

## Root files

- `config.yaml` — quick-access machine-readable config
- `CLAUDE.md` — agent identity + routing
- `lessons.md` — client-specific learnings (compounds over time)

## Getting started

1. Open `./{{slug}}.code-workspace` in VS Code (combines this repo + methodology; gitignored, machine-specific).
2. Fill `config.yaml`, then run `/build-brand-brain`.
3. Populate remaining `config/*` files.
4. Add brand assets to `brand/`.
